heck points, it quickly becomes a pain point.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExpand TileSet editor, zoom in and out with mousewheel.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis happens with any project.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112871/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}